{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"SUSE-SU-2026:22386-1","published":"2026-06-25T11:19:56Z","modified":"2026-07-02T18:24:16.411895533Z","related":["CVE-2026-23278","CVE-2026-31402","CVE-2026-31504","CVE-2026-31554","CVE-2026-31694","CVE-2026-43503","CVE-2026-46323"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-23278","CVE-2026-31402","CVE-2026-31504","CVE-2026-31554","CVE-2026-31694","CVE-2026-43503","CVE-2026-46323"],"summary":"Security update for the Linux Kernel (Live Patch 4 for SUSE Linux Enterprise 16)","details":"\nThis update for the SUSE Linux Enterprise Kernel 6.12.0-160000.9.1 fixes various security issues\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2026-23278: netfilter: nf_tables: always walk all pending catchall elements (bsc#1260907).\n- CVE-2026-31402: nfsd: fix heap overflow in NFSv4.0 LOCK replay cache (bsc#1261640).\n- CVE-2026-31504: net: fix fanout UAF in packet_release() via NETDEV_UP race (bsc#1263088).\n- CVE-2026-31554: futex: Require sys_futex_requeue() to have identical flags (bsc#1263108).\n- CVE-2026-31694: fuse: reject oversized dirents in page cache (bsc#1263902).\n- CVE-2026-43503: final dirty.frag related fixes (bsc#1266229).\n- CVE-2026-46323: net: gro: don't merge zcopy skbs (bsc#1268282).\n- net/sched: fix pedit partial COW leading to page cache (bsc#1267625).\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"kernel-livepatch-SLE16_Update_4","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Server 16.0","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/kernel-livepatch-SLE16_Update_4&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Server%2016.0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8-160000.1.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"kernel-livepatch-6_12_0-160000_9-default":"8-160000.1.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2026:22386-1.json"}},{"package":{"name":"kernel-livepatch-SLE16_Update_4","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Server for SAP applications 16.0","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/kernel-livepatch-SLE16_Update_4&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Server%20for%20SAP%20applications%2016.0"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8-160000.1.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"kernel-livepatch-6_12_0-160000_9-default":"8-160000.1.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2026:22386-1.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.suse.com/support/update/announcement/2026/suse-su-202622386-1/"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1260907"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1261640"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1263088"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1263108"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1263902"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1266229"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1267625"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.suse.com/1268282"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-23278"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-31402"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-31504"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-31554"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-31694"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-43503"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-46323"}]}